# .worktreeinclude — files to copy into git worktrees
# Docs: https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/worktrees
#
# When Claude Code creates a worktree (EnterWorktree), it copies these paths into the
# new worktree so the isolated branch has the config it needs.
# One path per line. Globs are supported.
#
# Examples:
#   .claude/settings.json
#   .claude/rules/
#   CLAUDE.md
#   .mcp.json
#   requirements.txt
#   src/ledger/Ledger.psd1
